{'symbol': 'BBY', 'date': '2022-11-23 10:09:00', 'title': 'SLEEPME INC. ROLLS OUT DOCK PRO SLEEP SYSTEMS AT SELECT BEST BUY® STORES FOR THE HOLIDAYS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--SLEEPME INC., THE PARENT COMPANY OF SLEEP TECHNOLOGY BRAND CHILISLEEP®, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT DOCK PRO SLEEP SYSTEMS ARE NOW AVAILABLE IN SELECT BEST BUY STORES JUST IN TIME FOR THE HOLIDAY SEASON.'}{'symbol': 'BBY', 'date': '2022-11-23 08:00:00', 'title': 'BEST BUY ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF BEST BUY CO., INC. (NYSE:BBY) HAS AUTHORIZED THE PAYMENT OF A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.88 PER COMMON SHARE. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 3, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 13, 2022. THE COMPANY HAD 225,216,862 SHARES OF COMMON STOCK ISSUED AND OUTSTANDING AS OF OCTOBER 29, 2022.'}